# Force Windows-native line endings for Windows-only scripts.
# Without this, Edit/Write tools and cross-platform editors can leave bat files
# with LF terminators, which Windows cmd technically tolerates but can mis-parse
# in some edge cases, and which break the conventional Windows-script contract.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
